    "detailed_description": "<i>In the midst of World War III, a streamer crash-lands in Mirka\u2014a town entangled in a secret war. They discover a covert military operation targeting both yetis and witches. A lone yeti named Henri, alongside an enigmatic witch, becomes their unexpected ally. Together, they expose the military's plans, forge a bond, and defy the odds, fighting to find the truth.</i><br><br>CONTROLS:<br>LEFT MOUSE CLICK anywhere on a page to move forward or backward a page.<br>M = Mute<br>Q = Quit<br>THE TABLE OF CONTENTS button in the top left corner will return you to Page 01.",
